# Facts about Tobias Fennick.

@fact tobias.scholarship
tier: surface
text: A farmer's son on a turnip scholarship, built like a barn door and gentle as a lamb.

@fact tobias.plants
tier: surface
text: He talks to plants. Worryingly, they seem to answer.

@fact tobias.ma
tier: personal
hint: Ask about harvest at home.
unlock: seen(tobias_homesick) > 0
text: His mother runs the farm alone at harvest. It's the first harvest he has ever missed.

@fact tobias.gerald
tier: personal
hint: Ask about the mandrake in the hat.
unlock: seen(tobias_godparent) > 0
text: He is raising a mandrake called Gerald, who wears a knitted hat and screams softly.

@fact tobias.moonflowers
tier: personal
hint: Look in the greenhouse at night.
unlock: rel(tobias) >= 12
text: The greenhouse moonflowers bloom once every eleven years. He would stand in a storm for them.

@fact tobias.blight
tier: secret
hint: Home may be having a bad year.
unlock: seen(tobias_bad_harvest) > 0
text: Blight took his family's harvest. Thirty crowns stood between them and a hungry winter.

@fact tobias.dancing
tier: personal
hint: Ask him about the Midwinter Ball.
unlock: seen(tobias_dance_lessons) > 0
text: He practised waltzing with a broom before the Midwinter Ball. The broom complained.

@fact tobias.after
tier: personal
hint: Ask what he'll do after graduation.
unlock: seen(tobias_home_or_here) > 0
text: His mother expects him home on the farm after graduation. It was always the plan; he isn't sure any more that it's his.

@fact tobias.weather_first
tier: personal
hint: Have tea at the Fennick farm.
unlock: seen(fennick_weather_first) > 0
text: His mother says the weather first and the love last, in person as in her letters. She has never once left the love out.

@fact tobias.mandrakes
tier: personal
hint: Look behind the farmhouse.
unlock: seen(fennick_mandrake_bed) > 0
text: Gerald came from a walled bed of mandrakes behind the farmhouse. Every one of them has a hat; his mother knits them all winter.

@fact tobias.offer
tier: personal
hint: Be at the farm when the man from the capital calls.
unlock: seen(fennick_good_boots) > 0
text: A man from the capital has offered to buy the Fennick farm, this year only. His mother didn't so much as answer him.

@fact tobias.outside
tier: secret
hint: Walk the top field with him.
unlock: seen(fennick_top_field) > 0
text: The Fennick farm lies outside both villages, and the valley's good years have never reached it. His mother says the valley's luck is the valley's business.
